--- JSONEachPacketString is rejected for SQLInsert schema with a non-UTF-8 type name
is not compatible with the output format SQLInsert
--- EventStream base64-encodes SQLInsert schema with a non-UTF-8 type name
SQLInsert schema payload with a non-UTF-8 type name round-trips
--- JSONEachPacketString accepts SQLInsert schema when a non-UTF-8 byte is in an ignored table-name comment
SQLInsert schema with a canonical UTF-8 table name accepted: OK
--- EventStream keeps SQLInsert schema with a canonical UTF-8 table name as text
text/event-stream; charset=UTF-8
